{"games":[{"id":2136022267,"name":"FNAF: The Original Trilogy Roleplay","desc":"DISCLAIMER: A decent computer is needed to play this game.\r\n\r\nGreetings, and welcome to FNAF: The Original Trilogy RP!\r\nThis roleplay game is a compilation of FNAF1, FNAF2 and FNAF3 packed into one single game.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n-Play as your favorite Five Nights at Freddy's characters ranging from Freddy Fazbear, Bonnie, Chica, Foxy, The Puppet, so many characters!\r\n-Roleplay in your favorite locations from the games\r\n-Badge Characters: There are badges hidden in different areas of the map, find their locations to unlock unique characters!\r\nThis game was made possible thanks to the huge success of our other FNAF RP game, Circus Baby's Pizza World Roleplay.\r\n\r\nCredits (Mostly listed in-game):\r\nIns1dious_Tim - Game Creator\r\nC1a4k_K3nt - Co-Creator\r\ntr_1cky - Helped with the game\r\nScott Cawthon - Creating Five Nights at Freddy's\r\nSteel Wool - Some props from FNAF:HW","path":"/game/2136022267-fnaf-the-original-trilogy-roleplay","slug":"2136022267-fnaf-the-original-trilogy-roleplay","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/48780e037239d0f368b45452f0104fb8125fb15bf903ac83b6d26aec26f1e41e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2b108817eb62e6189d894fa41fb6dbbe/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":34021557,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-06T10:30:55.525Z","creator":{"name":"Ins1dious_Tim","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":85610808173468,"name":"[COPYCAT] - ULTRA Battlegrounds","desc":"\"i'm going to ULTRAKILL you!!!\" (tell that to your friends)\nmore like ultra shenanigans. \n\n--[HOW TO PLAY]--\nM1 - basic attack\n1, 2, 3, 4 - abilities\nQ - dash/tech (side + back dashes have invincibility)\nF - block\nG - ult\nyellow = parryable, blue = unparryable, red = unblockable\n\n\n/// [6/6/2025 - The Interim Update pt. 2.3] ///\n- Made teching no longer share the cooldown of your side dashes (meaning you will no longer tech in place if your dashes are on cooldown)\n- Added failsafes for some characters i-frames not expiring\n- probably finally actually fixed the join invincible bug for real this time (fr)\n\nclearly inspired by the strongest battlegrounds, jujutsu shenanigans, and themed after ultrakill.\ndestruction inspired by classic brickbattle games.\n\nPC & mobile compatible, might be some issues.\nsolo dev project so expect bugs and jank. \nplease don't message me on roblox to report bugs, i dont like message limits or chat filters.\n","path":"/game/85610808173468-ultra-battlegrounds","slug":"85610808173468-ultra-battlegrounds","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/939164763b66bcad4ddbba26fda194252966f8f9088b1c9ef1fcbb8c25dc9244.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3f50e3f02e949c4ca8158e59515b86af/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1625578,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-05T14:22:22.236Z","creator":{"name":"SmallSonic45","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4973767695,"name":"[REWORK] RUSaken","desc":"(У вас есть время до 3 мая что бы накопить на лвл 100 на убийцах что бы они перенеслись в ритейк)","path":"/game/4973767695-rusaken","slug":"4973767695-rusaken","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a4144f510d87a04d311a1a886782c75c97f4047eb1baac016af525b84e08a432.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6cb77aa68a34a992206ffc22d32d7a34/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":6940043,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-05T12:59:07.108Z","creator":{"name":"RUSaken Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":125078281770321,"name":"warzone","desc":"a classic gun game!","path":"/game/125078281770321-warzone","slug":"125078281770321-warzone","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4bf0943feee1f7694b58f0e2f2c7e13baef61cb42dc56d1695f8f32852b3f33e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.c